## Description

Meet Alpamayo 2 Super, now commercially available for robotaxis and autonomous vehicles.  Built for complex real-world driving, this open reasoning model adds 360° awareness, high-level driving decisions and automated reasoning labels.  We built it, so you can build on it. https://t.co/OZBWtsu3FC

